# Build context for deploy/aws/Dockerfile (and upstream's root Dockerfile).
# Local env files, installs and build output never enter an image: every stage installs
# and builds from source, and runtime configuration comes from the task definition.

# Secrets and local state
**/.env*
.local
packages/db/certs/*

# Installs, build output and caches (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/src/generated
**/.prisma-clientjs-*
apps/*/prisma/schema/*.prisma
!apps/*/prisma/schema/schema.prisma

# Version control, worktrees and tooling not needed to build
.git
.worktrees
.claude
.superpowers
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.DS_Store
